ace \"taking guard\" in 1883. His pads and bat are very similar to those used today. The gloves have evolved somewhat. Many modern players use more defensive equipment than were available to Grace, most notably helmets and arm guards.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AWGGrace.jpg"}],"sounds":{"cricket field":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9d/En-au-cricket_field.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9d/En-au-cricket_field.ogg/En-au-cricket_field.ogg.mp3"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Green Fungi Log Singanally Coorg Nov24 A7CR 04866-90 zsp","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/47/Green_Fungi_Log_Singanally_Coorg_Nov24_A7CR_04866-90_zsp.jpg/500px-Green_Fungi_Log_Singanally_Coorg_Nov24_A7CR_04866-90_zsp.jpg","ratio":2.210970464135021,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Green_Fungi_Log_Singanally_Coorg_Nov24_A7CR_04866-90_zsp.jpg","share":0.0775},{"title":"Heidelberg Cricket Oval, Melbourne","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1b/Heidelberg_Cricket_Oval%2C_Melbourne.jpg/500px-Heidelberg_Cricket_Oval%2C_Melbourne.jpg","ratio":1.6899563318777293,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Heidelberg_Cricket_Oval,_Melbourne.jpg","share":0.064375},{"title":"Lijsterbes (Sorbus). 31-03-2024 (d.j.b.) 02","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/Lijsterbes_%28Sorbus%29._31-03-2024_%28d.j.b.%29_02.jpg/500px-Lijsterbes_%28Sorbus%29._31-03-2024_%28d.j.b.%29_02.jpg","ratio":0.7142266335814723,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lijsterbes_(Sorbus)._31-03-2024_(d.j.b.)_02.jpg","share":0.040625}]}}